# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the managed workflows client package, authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform, and verify your setup."
msgstr "Installa il pacchetto client dei workflow gestiti, autenticati su IBM Quantum Platform e verifica la tua configurazione."

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {#install}"
msgstr "Installazione {#install}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prerequisiti {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows enabled on your [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contact your administrator to enable it.\n"
msgstr "Workflow gestiti abilitati nelle tue [istanze di IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contatta il tuo amministratore per abilitarli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An API key and the CRN of your instance. See [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Una API key e il CRN della tua istanza. Vedi [Trova le tue credenziali di accesso](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later, in an active virtual environment. See [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) for how to set up an environment.\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 o successivo, in un ambiente virtuale attivo. Vedi [Installare Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) per sapere come configurare un ambiente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start with AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Avvio rapido con le skill AI {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the AI skills in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) to help you install `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, package your existing local code, and deploy it as a managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Puoi usare le skill AI nel [repository dei template di Qiskit Function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) per installare `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, pacchettizzare il tuo codice locale esistente e distribuirlo come workflow gestito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the client package {#install-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Installa il pacchetto client {#install-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the `qiskit-ibm-catalog` package:\n"
msgstr "Installa il pacchetto `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command also installs `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` as dependencies. You do not need to install `qiskit-serverless` separately. The examples in these guides require `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 or later, which installs `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"
msgstr "Questo comando installa anche `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit` e `qiskit-ibm-runtime` come dipendenze. Non è necessario installare `qiskit-serverless` separatamente. Gli esempi di queste guide richiedono `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 o successivo, che installa `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 e `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use two of these packages directly, in different places:\n"
msgstr "Usi direttamente due di questi pacchetti, in punti diversi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` is the client that you use on your local computer to upload workflows, run them, and get their results.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` è il client che usi sul tuo computer locale per caricare i workflow, eseguirli e ottenerne i risultati.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-serverless` runs inside your workflow code. It provides helpers such as `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, and `save_result()`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-serverless` viene eseguito all'interno del codice del tuo workflow. Fornisce helper come `get_arguments()`, `update_status()` e `save_result()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the client package {#update-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Aggiorna il pacchetto client {#update-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because managed workflows is in beta, the client package changes often. To check which version you have, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Poiché i workflow gestiti sono in beta, il pacchetto client cambia spesso. Per verificare quale versione hai, esegui il seguente comando:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or, in Python:\n"
msgstr "Or, in Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update to the latest version, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Per aggiornare all'ultima versione, esegui il seguente comando:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the new version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requires a newer version of `qiskit-serverless`, this command also updates `qiskit-serverless`.\n"
msgstr "Se la nuova versione di `qiskit-ibm-catalog` richiede una versione più recente di `qiskit-serverless`, questo comando aggiorna anche `qiskit-serverless`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate {#authenticate}"
msgstr "Autenticazione {#authenticate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"Do not include your API key in your workflow code, in scripts, or in notebook files. A running workflow uses the credentials and instance that you used to call `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Proteggi la tua API key\">\n"
"Non includere la tua API key nel codice del workflow, negli script o nei file notebook. Un workflow in esecuzione usa le credenziali e l'istanza che hai usato per chiamare `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The managed workflows client uses the same credentials as `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. If you already saved an account with `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, the client loads your default saved account, and you can skip to [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"
msgstr "Il client dei workflow gestiti usa le stesse credenziali di `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Se hai già salvato un account con `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, il client carica il tuo account salvato predefinito e puoi passare direttamente a [Verifica la tua configurazione](#verify-your-setup).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not saved an account, save your API key and instance CRN one time in a trusted environment:\n"
msgstr "Se non hai salvato un account, salva la tua API key e il CRN dell'istanza una sola volta in un ambiente attendibile:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method writes your credentials to the same file as [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). The client uses the `ibm_quantum_platform` channel by default, so you do not need to set `channel`. To save more than one account, set `name`, and pass the same `name` when you create the client.\n"
msgstr "Questo metodo scrive le tue credenziali nello stesso file di [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). Il client usa per impostazione predefinita il canale `ibm_quantum_platform`, quindi non è necessario impostare `channel`. Per salvare più di un account, imposta `name` e passa lo stesso `name` quando crei il client.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more options, such as saving several accounts or selecting an instance automatically, see [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). If you work on a public computer or another untrusted environment, do not save your credentials. Instead, follow [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
msgstr "Per altre opzioni, come salvare più account o selezionare automaticamente un'istanza, vedi [Salva le tue credenziali di accesso](/guides/save-credentials). Se lavori su un computer pubblico o in un altro ambiente non attendibile, non salvare le tue credenziali. Segui invece [Inizializzare il servizio in un ambiente non attendibile](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your setup {#verify-your-setup}"
msgstr "Verifica la tua configurazione {#verify-your-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to managed workflows with your saved account, and list the workflows that you uploaded:\n"
msgstr "Connettiti ai workflow gestiti con il tuo account salvato ed elenca i workflow che hai caricato:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not uploaded a workflow yet, the output is an empty list (`[]`). If you see an authentication error, the client did not find valid credentials. Check the account that you saved in the [Authenticate](#authenticate) section.\n"
msgstr "Se non hai ancora caricato un workflow, l'output è un elenco vuoto (`[]`). Se vedi un errore di autenticazione, il client non ha trovato credenziali valide. Controlla l'account che hai salvato nella sezione [Autenticazione](#authenticate).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Prossimi passi {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) to upload a workflow, run it, and get its result.\n"
"- To start from working code, deploy one of the [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), or adapt a base template for your own workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"- [Distribuisci il tuo primo workflow gestito](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) per caricare un workflow, eseguirlo e ottenerne il risultato.\n"
"- Per partire da codice funzionante, distribuisci uno dei [template di Qiskit Function](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), oppure adatta un template di base al tuo workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
